         VALUES ('x7gvAAAACAAJ', 'Moomin, Mymble and Little My', array['Tove Jansson'], 2001, 'Finnish artist Tove Jansson''s Moomin stories have been continually in print for more than half a century, in 35 languages. They are among Europe''s best loved and enduring children''s classics, and through the TV animation (BBC2), the warm-hearted, whimsical creatures of Moomin valley have been brought to a new younger British audience.Introducing the first Sort Of Children''s Classic in a new English version by Sophie Hannah. Sort of Books proudly presents the original full colour Moomin picture book with its irresistible cut-out page designs and playful rhyming text in a new version by one of Britain''s star poets.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=x7gvAAAACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 0, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=x7gvAAAACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
