         VALUES ('0eC1mAEACAAJ', 'Banana Republic: Richie''s Run', array['Glenn A. Bruce'], 2019, 'Richie Makepeace flees to South America after being framed for a double-murder in Miami. After settling on La Vaca, a classic tiny town on the edge of the Colombian jungle, he meets Vicki Freeman, a top fashion model with a thing for "bad boys." While Richie fights falling for her, she and her rich boyfriend devise a wild "adventurous" plan that will rely on Richie helping them, something he does NOT want to do. But with cash running out, he concedes and sets up what will result in chaos, backstabbing, and bloodshed. The rules of the jungle will prevail and those unprepared will pay the highest price.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=0eC1mAEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 442, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=0eC1mAEACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
