         VALUES ('xHBZzwEACAAJ', 'DNA Never Lies', array['Sue George'], 2022, 'Barbara was an ambitious young woman in the years after WW2, paying a high price for pursuing her dreams. Decades later, family DNA tests reveal she had lied... but about what, and why? Genealogist Karen Copperfield investigates.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=xHBZzwEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 0, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=xHBZzwEACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
