         VALUES ('k0ezDAEACAAJ', 'Thicker Than Water', array['Sally Spencer'], 2016, 'DCI Monika Paniatowski is only just back from maternity leave when she is called in to investigate the murder of a mother of three small children. Her husband is a wealthy politician, and the prime suspect. Following a nasty twist the investigation is suddenly national news. Monika''s sure she has the right man - but how to prove it?', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=k0ezDAEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 0, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=k0ezDAEACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
