         VALUES ('1FNSvgAACAAJ', 'Death on Demand', array['Jim Kelly'], 2017, 'When the newspapers turn up to cover Ruby Bright''s 100th birthday, they find her seaside care home is a murder scene. Someone spirited Ruby away by wheelchair to the water''s edge and strangled her. But why kill a harmless centurion? As Shaw and Valentine investigate, it''s clear Ruby wasn''t the first victim - and nor is she the last.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=1FNSvgAACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 336, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=1FNSvgAACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
