         VALUES ('vAsdDgAAQBAJ', 'Ill Will', array['Dan Chaon'], 2017, '"A psychologist in suburban Cleveland, Dustin is drifting through his forties when he hears the news: his adopted brother Rusty is being released from prison. Thirty years ago, Rusty received a life sentence for the massacre of Dustin''s parents, aunt, and uncle. The trial came to epitomize the 1980s hysteria over Satanic cults; despite the lack of physical evidence, the jury believed the outlandish accusations Dustin and his cousin made against Rusty. Now, after DNA analysis has overturned the conviction, Dustin braces for a reckoning"--Dust jacket flap.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=vAsdDgAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api', 481, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=vAsdDgAAQBAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
