         VALUES ('OKWefcXn5XgC', 'An Echo in the Darkness', array['Francine Rivers'], 2002, 'This classic series has inspired nearly 2 million readers. Both loyal fans and new readers will want the latest edition of this beloved series. This edition includes a foreword from the publisher, a preface from Francine Rivers and discussion questions suitable for personal and group use. #2 An Echo in the Darkness: Turning away from the opulence of Rome, Marcus is led by a whispering voice from the past into a journey that could set him free from the darkness of his soul.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=OKWefcXn5XgC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 484, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=OKWefcXn5XgC&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
