         VALUES ('5MgfAQAAIAAJ', 'Aristotle and Poetic Justice', array['Margaret Anne Doody'], 2002, '330BC: it is the year that Alexander the Great sacked Persepolis and won the greatest fortune the world had ever known. Stephnaos and his teacher, the philosopher Aristotle, are drawn into solving the perplexing abduction case of Anthia, the heiress of a prominent silver merchant.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=5MgfAQAAIAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 356, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=5MgfAQAAIAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
