         VALUES ('b8rqzgEACAAJ', 'The Romantic', array['William Boyd'], 2022, 'A new "whole life" novel from William Boyd, the author of Any Human Heart. Set in the 19th century, the novel follows the roller-coaster fortunes of a man as he tries to negotiate the random stages, adventures and vicissitudes of his life. He is variously a soldier, a farmer, a pawnbroker, a bankrupt, a jailbird, a writer, a gigolo - and many other manifestations - and, finally, a minor diplomat, based in Trieste (then in Austria-Hungary) where he sees out the end of his days.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=b8rqzgEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 0, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=b8rqzgEACAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
