         VALUES ('fEA7MuMoLqcC', 'Across the Great Divide', array['Barney Hoskyns'], 2006, '(Book). This is a vivid and rollicking account of The Band''s journey across three decades. Spanning the history of American rock and boasting a supporting cast that includes Dylan, Janis Joplin, and U2, the book brilliantly captures the raw magic and complex personalities of a group George Harrison called "the best band in the history of the universe." This revised U.S. edition includes a postscript, together with an obituary of Rick Danko and a brand-new interview with Robbie Robertson.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=fEA7MuMoLqcC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api', 500, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=fEA7MuMoLqcC&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
