         VALUES ('bbzaAAAAMAAJ', 'Louis Pasteur', array['Patrice Debré'], 1998, 'Distinguished French immunologist and physician Patrice Debré offers an extensive, balanced, and detailed account of Louis Pasteur''s life, struggles, and contributions. Drawing heavily on Pasteur''s own scientific notebooks and writings, Debré presents a complete critical account of his discoveries and the controversies they raised with other scientists and occasionally with his closest associates.', 'https://books.google.com/books/content?id=bbzaAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api', 608, 'http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=bbzaAAAAMAAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api') ON CONFLICT (bookId) DO NOTHING;
